WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.247
Exploratory data analysis gives us a quick picture of the dataset before deeper analysis.

00:00:06.247 --> 00:00:16.722
Describe summarizes the numeric amount column with count, mean, standard deviation, quartiles, minimum, and maximum.

00:00:16.722 --> 00:00:20.727
Value_counts tells us how often each channel appears.

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:30.232
These simple summaries can reveal skew, unexpected ranges, dominant categories, and other patterns worth investigating.

00:00:30.232 --> 00:00:34.895
EDA is about asking better questions before making conclusions.
